---
permalink: ./arknights.html
title: 明日方舟 · 泰拉观测入口
bodyClass: world-arknights ark-world-home
pageType: arknights-home
worldId: arknights
cssFiles:
  - base.css
  - nav.css
  - worlds.css
  - arknights-world.css
  - responsive.css
  - reading-experience.css
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<article class="terra-world" id="terra-world" aria-labelledby="terra-world-title">
  <header class="terra-hero">
    <div class="terra-hero-grid" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 960 560" role="img">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="terra-route" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0" stop-color="#f0b44d" stop-opacity=".12"/>
            <stop offset=".5" stop-color="#f0b44d" stop-opacity=".82"/>
            <stop offset="1" stop-color="#79b8c8" stop-opacity=".16"/>
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
        <g class="terra-grid-lines">
          <path d="M40 92H920M40 180H920M40 268H920M40 356H920M40 444H920"/>
          <path d="M128 40V520M304 40V520M480 40V520M656 40V520M832 40V520"/>
        </g>
        <g class="terra-routes">
          <path d="M86 394C202 280 258 424 372 282S584 164 662 236 812 314 900 128"/>
          <path d="M138 118C254 212 326 146 420 218S594 410 742 358 828 272 904 312"/>
          <path d="M224 496C260 370 418 408 484 318S610 86 766 98"/>
        </g>
        <g class="terra-nodes">
          <circle cx="86" cy="394" r="5"/><circle cx="372" cy="282" r="8"/>
          <circle cx="662" cy="236" r="5"/><circle cx="900" cy="128" r="9"/>
          <circle cx="138" cy="118" r="6"/><circle cx="420" cy="218" r="5"/>
          <circle cx="742" cy="358" r="8"/><circle cx="904" cy="312" r="4"/>
          <circle cx="224" cy="496" r="5"/><circle cx="484" cy="318" r="7"/>
          <circle cx="766" cy="98" r="6"/>
        </g>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="terra-status" aria-label="泰拉观测状态">
      <span><i></i> SIGNAL ACQUIRED</span>
      <span>ATS / WORLD-01</span>
      <span>档案核验 {{ arknights.archive.coverage.updatedAt }}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="terra-hero-copy">
      <p class="terra-kicker">TERRA / ORIGINIUM OBSERVATION</p>
      <h1 id="terra-world-title">
        <span class="terra-title-cn">明日方舟</span>
        <span class="terra-title-en">ARKNIGHTS</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="terra-title-sub">泰拉档案 / TERRA ARCHIVE</p>
      <p class="terra-hero-summary">天灾迫使城市不断迁徙，源石推动工业发展，也带来矿石病；各国、组织与个人共同塑造了今天的泰拉。这里收录主世界线、集成战略与地域图谱。</p>
      <a class="terra-chronicle-launch" href="./arknights-chronicle.html">
        <span>CHRONICLE / 01</span>
        <strong>进入主世界线</strong>
        <i>查阅泰拉编年 →</i>
      </a>
    </div>

    <a class="terra-latest" href="./arknights-is-blackflow.html">
      <span>最新观测 / IS-07</span>
      <strong>沉沦者的黑流树海</strong>
      <small>最新记录仍在核验 · 进入树海 →</small>
    </a>
  </header>

  {% include "reading-entrance.njk" %}

  <section class="terra-secondary" id="terra-atlas" aria-labelledby="terra-atlas-title">
    <div class="terra-section-heading">
      <span>ATLAS / 03</span>
      <h2 id="terra-atlas-title">泰拉图谱</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="terra-atlas-grid">
      <article class="terra-atlas-map-card">
        <button type="button" class="terra-map-open" data-terra-map-open aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-controls="terra-map-dialog">
          <img src="./assets/images/arknights/terra-community-administrative-map-preview.webp" width="960" height="1291" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="泰拉诸国行政概略图缩略图">
          <span>REGIONS / COMMUNITY MAP</span>
          <span class="terra-map-card-copy">
            <strong>地域与国家</strong>
            <small>维多利亚、卡西米尔、萨米、炎国、伊比利亚与更多事件坐标。</small>
            <i>点击查看全图 ↗</i>
          </span>
        </button>
      </article>
      <article><span>ORGANIZATIONS</span><h3>组织与阵营</h3><p>罗德岛、各国机构、科研团体与非国家力量的行动关系。</p></article>
      <article><span>CONCEPTS</span><h3>关键概念</h3><p>源石、天灾、海嗣、坍缩，以及泰拉文明始终要面对的问题。</p></article>
    </div>
    <p class="terra-note">地图由社区作者绘制；六边形区域依据官方公开信息，地形与部分标注为社区补充。</p>
  </section>

  <section class="terra-secondary terra-is-preview" id="observations" aria-labelledby="observations-title">
    <div class="terra-section-heading">
      <span>INTEGRATED STRATEGIES / 02</span>
      <h2 id="observations-title">集成战略专题</h2>
      <a href="./arknights-integrated-strategies.html">查看完整索引 →</a>
    </div>
    <p class="terra-is-preview-intro">七次探索各自拥有独立的背景、规则与结局记录。</p>
    <div class="terra-is-preview-grid">
      {% for topic in arknightsTopics %}
      <a class="terra-is-preview-card" href="./arknights-is-{{ topic.slug }}.html" data-context="{{ topic.id }}">
        <span>IS-0{{ topic.order }}</span>
        <strong>{{ topic.name }}</strong>
        <p>{{ topic.synopsis }}</p>
        <i>进入专题 →</i>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <dialog class="terra-map-dialog" id="terra-map-dialog" aria-labelledby="terra-map-dialog-title">
    <div class="terra-map-dialog-shell">
      <header>
        <div>
          <span>COMMUNITY CARTOGRAPHY / TERRA</span>
          <h2 id="terra-map-dialog-title">泰拉诸国行政概略图</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="terra-map-dialog-actions">
          <button type="button" data-terra-map-zoom aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="terra-map-viewport">放大 2×</button>
          <a class="terra-map-download" href="./assets/images/arknights/terra-community-administrative-map.png" download="terra-community-administrative-map.png">保存原图 ↓</a>
          <button type="button" data-terra-map-close aria-label="关闭地图">关闭 ×</button>
        </div>
      </header>
      <figure>
        <div class="terra-map-viewport" id="terra-map-viewport" tabindex="0" aria-label="泰拉地图查看区域；双击可切换两倍放大">
          <img src="./assets/images/arknights/terra-community-administrative-map.png" width="4081" height="5488" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="社区绘制的泰拉诸国行政概略图" draggable="false">
        </div>
        <figcaption>六边形区域依据官方公开信息；地形与部分标注由社区补充。地图署名保留于原图。双击地图可切换两倍放大。</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </dialog>
</article>
{% endblock %}
